# Cloudflare Workers static-asset headers file — applies to every response
# served from this site (see /workers/static-assets/headers/ in Cloudflare's
# docs). Added per the Sept 2026 site audit: the site was shipping with none
# of these, low risk for a brochure site but free to add.
#
# Strict-Transport-Security here only takes effect once a visitor has
# actually reached the site over HTTPS — it does not by itself redirect a
# plain http:// request. That redirect still has to be turned on separately
# in Cloudflare (SSL/TLS > Edge Certificates > "Always Use HTTPS"), which is
# a dashboard setting, not something this file can do.
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
